{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經云。極無自性心生文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云。又深知一切法無自性\n文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "私云。法界體者。本有六大也。故即身義云。故佛說六大。為法界體性文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
