{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略抄。此約能詮示顯密異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略抄。此約所詮辨淺深也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大師釋云。圓圓海德諸佛者　自性法身也。"}
